{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19617","headline":"赠毛仙翁 · 李翱","name":"赠毛仙翁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"紫霄仙客下三山，因救生灵到世间。\n龟鹤计年承甲子，冰霜爲质驻童颜。\n韬藏休咎传真籙，变化荣枯试小还。\n从此便教尘骨贵，九霄云路愿追攀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李翱","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19617.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19617","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}